### Phase 3: Promotion Switcher (Header Dropdown)

#### [NEW] `app/Livewire/PromotionSwitcher.php`

```php
class PromotionSwitcher extends Component
{
    public ?int $selected = null;

    public function mount(): void
    {
        $this->selected = session('current_promotion_id')
            ?? Promotion::where('is_active', true)->value('id');
    }

    public function switch(int $id): void
    {
        session(['current_promotion_id' => $id]);
        $this->redirect(request()->header('Referer'));
    }
}
```

#### [NEW] `resources/views/livewire/promotion-switcher.blade.php`

Styled dropdown matching Filament's header. Shows promotion name + date range.

#### [MODIFY] [AdminPanelProvider.php](file:///d:/HP%20PAVLION/projects/coca-cola-bot/app/Providers/Filament/AdminPanelProvider.php)

```php
use Filament\Support\Facades\FilamentView;
use Filament\View\PanelsRenderHook;

FilamentView::registerRenderHook(
    PanelsRenderHook::GLOBAL_SEARCH_BEFORE,
    fn () => Blade::render('@livewire("promotion-switcher")')
);
```

#### [NEW] `app/Filament/Traits/HasPromotionScope.php`

```php
trait HasPromotionScope
{
    protected function getPromotionId(): ?int
    {
        return session('current_promotion_id')
            ?? Promotion::where('is_active', true)->value('id');
    }
}
```

> [!TIP]
> **Performance**: `Promotion::where('is_active', true)->value('id')` is a single indexed query returning one int. With only ~5-10 promotions ever, this is instant. Session caches it for the request.

---

### Phase 4: Filter Resources/Pages/Widgets

#### Resources (table queries)

Each resource's table class gets `->modifyQueryUsing()`:

```php
->modifyQueryUsing(fn (Builder $query) =>
    $query->where('promotion_id', session('current_promotion_id'))
)
```

Applies to: [Codes](file:///d:/HP%20PAVLION/projects/coca-cola-bot/app/Filament/Pages/TotalStats.php#52-119), [Prizes](file:///d:/HP%20PAVLION/projects/coca-cola-bot/app/Models/StatsDailyPrizes.php#8-24), [Drinks](file:///d:/HP%20PAVLION/projects/coca-cola-bot/app/Models/StatsDailyDrinks.php#7-22), `Orders`, `SuperGameTickets`, `RedeemedCodes`

#### Pages

[TotalStats](file:///d:/HP%20PAVLION/projects/coca-cola-bot/app/Filament/Pages/TotalStats.php#11-120), [Statistics](file:///d:/HP%20PAVLION/projects/coca-cola-bot/app/Filament/Pages/Statistics.php#16-147), `DrinkStatistics` — add `->where('promotion_id', ...)` to all Eloquent queries.

#### Widgets

[StatsOverview](file:///d:/HP%20PAVLION/projects/coca-cola-bot/app/Filament/Widgets/StatsOverview.php#11-33), `CodesByRegion`, `LatestOrders`, `LatestRedeemedCodes`, `OrdersByRegion` — scope queries.

> [!TIP]
> **No N+1 or full table scans** — every query hits a composite index (`promotion_id + date` or `promotion_id + code_prize`). With 25K codes filtered to one promotion, queries return in < 5ms.

