### Phase 5: CodeController — Scope to Promotion

#### [MODIFY] [CodeController.php](file:///d:/HP%20PAVLION/projects/coca-cola-bot/app/Http/Controllers/Api/CodeController.php)

Code already has `promotion_id`. When redeeming, pass it through to stats:

```php
$stats = StatsDaily::firstOrCreate([
    'date' => today(),
    'region_id' => $user->region_id,
    'promotion_id' => $code->promotion_id, // ← add this
], [...]);
```

Same for [StatsDailyDrinks](file:///d:/HP%20PAVLION/projects/coca-cola-bot/app/Models/StatsDailyDrinks.php#7-22) and [StatsDailyPrizes](file:///d:/HP%20PAVLION/projects/coca-cola-bot/app/Models/StatsDailyPrizes.php#8-24).

---

### Phase 6: Backfill & Activate

#### [NEW] `BackfillPromotionIds` command

```bash
php artisan promotions:backfill
```

- Uses **chunked updates** (`chunkById(1000)`) to avoid memory issues with big data
- Sets `promotion_id` on all existing codes, prizes, drinks, stats
- Enables [PromotionResource](file:///d:/HP%20PAVLION/projects/coca-cola-bot/app/Filament/Resources/Promotions/PromotionResource.php#19-78) in navigation

---

